  "body": {
    "storage": {
      "value": "<p>Hi&nbsp; &nbsp;all</p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(23,43,77);\">《冬日纪念册》活动于1月18日0点-1月22日24点上线，</span><span style=\"color: rgb(23,43,77);\">现同步Day5数据情况：</span></p><p>具体数据如下：<br /><strong>1、活动目标完成情况：</strong></p><p>活动目标：活动钻石消耗达<strong>3000w钻石</strong><br />活动消耗达2399w<strong>钻石</strong>，目标完成度为79.99%。</p><table class=\"wrapped\"><tbody class=\"\"><tr class=\"\"><td>项目</td><td>目标值</td><td>活动消耗</td><td>目标完成度</td><td>时间进度</td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td>冬日纪念册</td><td>30,000,000</td><td>23996757</td><td>79.99%</td><td>100%</td></tr></tbody></table><p>消耗情况：普通礼物消耗2048w钻，特殊礼物消耗351w钻。</p><p><strong>2、大盘数据情况：</strong></p><p>活动消耗占比大盘消耗的13.68%，专属礼物消耗占比大盘礼物消耗的26.42%；</p><table class=\"wrapped\"><tbody class=\"\"><tr class=\"\"><td colspan=\"8\">每日数据情况</td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td>日期</td><td>主板消耗</td><td>礼物消耗</td><td>活动消耗</td><td>活动礼物消耗</td><td>特殊礼物消耗</td><td>活动占主板</td><td>礼物消耗占比</td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td>1月18日</td><td>36,416,051&nbsp;</td><td>18,667,754&nbsp;</td><td>5,917,252&nbsp;</td><td>5,081,252&nbsp;</td><td>836,000&nbsp;</td><td>16.25%</td><td>31.70%</td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td>1月19日</td><td>35,452,150&nbsp;</td><td>18,420,763&nbsp;</td><td>5,510,113&nbsp;</td><td>4,625,513&nbsp;</td><td>884,600&nbsp;</td><td>15.54%</td><td>29.91%</td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td>1月20日</td><td>33,543,903&nbsp;</td><td>18,179,408&nbsp;</td><td>4,995,184&nbsp;</td><td>4,304,584&nbsp;</td><td>690,600&nbsp;</td><td>14.89%</td><td>27.48%</td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td>1月21日</td><td>34,278,838&nbsp;</td><td>17,032,807&nbsp;</td><td>3,812,752&nbsp;</td><td>3,250,152&nbsp;</td><td>562,600&nbsp;</td><td>11.12%</td><td>22.38%</td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td>1月22日</td><td>35779851</td><td>18526931</td><td>3,761,456&nbsp;</td><td>3,221,656</td><td>539,800</td><td>10.51%</td><td>20.30%</td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td>合计</td><td>175,470,793&nbsp;</td><td>90,827,663&nbsp;</td><td>23,996,757&nbsp;</td><td>20,483,157&nbsp;</td><td>3,513,600&nbsp;</td><td>13.68%</td><td>26.42%</td></tr></tbody></table><p class=\"auto-cursor-target\"><br /></p><p><strong>主播收礼：</strong></p><p>全部礼物，派对和秀场主播的收礼占比为：76:24，派对侧送礼钻石数1817万钻，主播侧收礼钻石数581万钻。</p><table class=\"wrapped\"><colgroup class=\"\"><col class=\"\" style=\"width: 57.6pt;\" /><col class=\"\" style=\"width: 60.8pt;\" /><col class=\"\" style=\"width: 81.2pt;\" /></colgroup><tbody class=\"\"><tr class=\"\"><td>送礼场景</td><td>送礼钻石数</td><td>占比</td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td>派对</td><td>18177998</td><td>75.75%</td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td>秀场</td><td>5818759</td><td>24.25%</td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td>总计</td><td>23996757</td><td><br /></td></tr></tbody></table><p><strong>3、各层级主播收礼数据</strong></p><p>派对侧收礼的主播主要集中在SB层级，秀场侧收礼的主播主要集中B层级。</p><table class=\"wrapped\"><colgroup class=\"\"><col class=\"\" style=\"width: 48.0pt;\" /><col class=\"\" style=\"width: 59.6pt;\" /><col class=\"\" style=\"width: 82.8pt;\" /><col class=\"\" style=\"width: 56.4pt;\" /><col class=\"\" style=\"width: 82.8pt;\" /></colgroup><tbody class=\"\"><tr class=\"\"><td>主播61日动态层级</td><td>派对</td><td>占比</td><td>秀场</td><td>占比</td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td>S</td><td>4,334,000&nbsp;</td><td>21.50%</td><td>704,819&nbsp;</td><td>3.50%</td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td>A</td><td>2,235&nbsp;</td><td>0.01%</td><td>666,040&nbsp;</td><td>3.30%</td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td>B</td><td>2,791,479&nbsp;</td><td>13.85%</td><td>2,351,392&nbsp;</td><td>11.67%</td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td>B-</td><td>2,016,069&nbsp;</td><td>10.00%</td><td>598,813&nbsp;</td><td>2.97%</td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td>C</td><td>2,232,725&nbsp;</td><td>11.08%</td><td>419,480&nbsp;</td><td>2.08%</td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td>D</td><td>768,297&nbsp;</td><td>3.81%</td><td>98,124&nbsp;</td><td>0.49%</td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td>N</td><td>3,169,142&nbsp;</td><td>15.72%</td><td>976&nbsp;</td><td>0.00%</td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td>总计</td><td>15,313,947&nbsp;</td><td>75.99%</td><td>4,839,644&nbsp;</td><td>24.01%</td></tr></tbody></table><p><strong>4、各层级用户送礼数据</strong></p><p>派对侧送礼的用户主要集中BD层级，秀场侧送礼的用户主要集中在A层级。</p><table class=\"relative-table wrapped\" style=\"width: 32.2887%;\"><colgroup class=\"\"><col class=\"\" style=\"width: 34.0857%;\" /><col class=\"\" style=\"width: 18.8661%;\" /><col class=\"\" style=\"width: 14.7441%;\" /><col class=\"\" style=\"width: 18.8661%;\" /><col class=\"\" style=\"width: 13.4758%;\" /></colgroup><tbody class=\"\"><tr class=\"\"><td>用户25日动态层级</td><td>派对</td><td>占比</td><td>秀场</td><td>占比</td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td>S</td><td>55,286&nbsp;</td><td>0.27%</td><td>268,042&nbsp;</td><td>1.32%</td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td>A</td><td>1,366,784&nbsp;</td><td>6.75%</td><td>1,007,887&nbsp;</td><td>4.98%</td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td>B</td><td>5,461,003&nbsp;</td><td>26.99%</td><td>1,423,070&nbsp;</td><td>7.03%</td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td>C</td><td>2,452,451&nbsp;</td><td>12.12%</td><td>658,281&nbsp;</td><td>3.25%</td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td>D</td><td>3,533,876&nbsp;</td><td>17.46%</td><td>990,764&nbsp;</td><td>4.90%</td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td>E</td><td>1,905,156&nbsp;</td><td>9.42%</td><td>392,023&nbsp;</td><td>1.94%</td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td>F</td><td>431,247&nbsp;</td><td>2.13%</td><td>60,867&nbsp;</td><td>0.30%</td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td>N</td><td>130,614&nbsp;</td><td>0.65%</td><td>97,950&nbsp;</td><td>0.48%</td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td>总计</td><td>15,336,417&nbsp;</td><td>75.79%</td><td>4,898,884&nbsp;</td><td>24.21%</td></tr></tbody></table><p><br /></p><p><br /></p><p><br /></p><p><br /></p><p><br /></p><p><br /></p><p><br /></p><p><br /></p><p><br /></p><p><br /></p><p><br /></p><p><br /></p><p><br /></p>",
